# Build output at any depth: a bare `target/` matches only the context root,
# so a standalone tool's or the eval crate's target/ (tools/*/target,
# evals/target) would otherwise enter the context (issue #141).
**/target/
.cargo-home/
.git/
.github/
dist/
# The run's own harness state and evidence are not build inputs — and a
# stray SQLite file from a local seat must never enter the image. The
# state home is .brokkr/ (it moved from .forge/), and the database
# patterns are recursive: a bare `*.db` matches only at the context root
# (issue #103). WAL/SHM companions and lock sidecars go with them.
.brokkr/
.forge/
.specify/
# The client fixture packages are not build inputs (issue #162).
clients/
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.db.lock
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
